This product carries six published structure-prediction models behind one JAX
interface. Five are independent JAX reimplementations; AlphaFold 3 carries
upstream's own source. None is an official project of the organisation that
published the original, and no model weights are distributed with this
software.

  AlphaFold 3 https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold3
               Apache-2.0, Copyright 2024 DeepMind Technologies Limited
               -> src/foldjax/models/alphafold3/_upstream/{LICENSE,NOTICE}
               Python/C++ source and first-use build inputs are vendored.
               ABI-specific binaries and generated CCD tables are built into
               FoldJAX's writable runtime store. Model parameters are not
               included and remain subject to Google's separate terms.

  Boltz-2      https://github.com/jwohlwend/boltz
               MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 Jeremy Wohlwend, Gabriele Corso,
               Saro Passaro and contributors
               -> src/foldjax/models/boltz2/{LICENSE,NOTICE}

